odify it - the `create_tween()` call just crashes the third time the opening animation plays.\n\n[godot.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21399602/godot.log)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI have so far failed to create a good reproduction of this aside from inside my entire project- and I unfortunately do not have much time / energy to dig into this further right now. Wanted to report anyway incase the crash log is sufficient to fix. If I manage to find a better reproduction I'll add it here.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108922/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}